message: "If you use this repository, cite the software and the associated manuscript."
title: "Leakage-Safe Benchmarking of Time-Frequency Fusion and Calibrated Self-Training for Bearing Fault Diagnosis"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "ddlinSpark"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ddlinSpark/leakage-safe-bearing-benchmark"
url: "https://github.com/ddlinSpark/leakage-safe-bearing-benchmark"
license: MIT
version: "0.2.0"
keywords:
  - bearing fault diagnosis
  - domain generalization
  - data leakage
  - time-frequency learning
  - self-training
  - calibration
abstract: >-
  Reproducible code and derived results for a leakage-safe Paderborn bearing
  fault diagnosis benchmark using simultaneous unseen-bearing and
  unseen-operating-condition holdout, same-protocol external adaptations, and
  fold-aware statistical analysis.
